## Breaking changes

* `ObservabilityS3Destination.config.roleArn`: pattern narrowed from `^arn:aws(?:-[a-z]+)*:iam::\d{12}:role\/[\w+=,.@/-]{1,512}$` to `^arn:aws:iam::\d{12}:role\/[\w+=,.@/-]{1,512}$`Action required

